flowchart TB
    game[WoW client<br/>Owns disk flush timing]
    subgraph addon[RaidManager addon - intended components]
        capture[Character and loadout capture]
        saves[Saved-instance capture<br/>Completeness and reset data]
        export[SavedVariables snapshot<br/>Version and observation time]
        importer[Roster importer<br/>Selected characters and revision]
        invites[Invitation controls<br/>Officer action in game]
    end
    subgraph companion[Desktop companion - intended components]
        watcher[Installation and account watcher<br/>Only player-selected folders]
        parser[Snapshot parser<br/>Validate data without executing Lua]
        pending[Retry buffer<br/>Stable snapshot identity]
        uploader[Authenticated uploader<br/>Pairing revocation and sync status]
    end
    api[RaidManager API]
    game -->|in-game observations| capture
    game -->|saved-instance observations| saves
    capture -->|observed fields| export
    saves -->|complete or incomplete scan| export
    export -->|game flushes file| watcher
    watcher -->|completed file| parser
    parser -->|valid snapshot| pending
    pending -->|retry until acknowledged| uploader
    uploader -->|HTTPS| api
    importer -->|current roster| invites

    classDef internal fill:#cfe2f3,stroke:#2c5aa0,stroke-width:1px,color:#000
    classDef external fill:#e8e8e8,stroke:#666,stroke-width:1px,color:#000
    class capture,saves,export,importer,invites,watcher,parser,pending,uploader internal
    class game,api external
